{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>I shall recount</b> — the words of David together with his prophecy, or the words of the poet speaking on his behalf." "<b>And the meaning of אל חק</b> — that which I shall recount, I establish as a חק (decree) that it be recounted: namely, He said to me, \"You are My son\" — to serve HaShem, as a son honors his father." "<b>I this day have begotten you</b> — like: צור ילדך תשי (Deut. 32:18)."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:26:02.390537654Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}